      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("That was the last. A bitter day’s work, and no memory to be proud of."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("<small>(_A shame we missed the opportunity to rid the forests of dwarves, as well.)</small>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We have finally reached Saurgrath, their capital. Remember whose side they have taken in the war against us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Now is our chance to finish them off..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I fear this will be a bloodbath..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Destroy them, root and branch. Burn out their homes. Let none remain alive!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Kalenz is not able to recruit or recall shamans or any of their advancements in this scenario."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "die",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22race%22%3A%22lizard%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "capture",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_capturer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Landar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("These are but eggs and hatchlings."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Do not spare them. They will only foul our forests anew when they get their growth."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("They even shatter our eggs!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Anduilas",
            text: _("But... to kill their young? Are we to go that far?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Stay. You need not have the blood of children on your hands, and I shall not."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Perhaps you are too tender-minded to do what must be done, but many of us are not."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I will not set elf against elf. But, Landar, I fear you are storing up a dreadful price for yourself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Stand aside. I will do what is needful."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Their revenge is terrible! I fear for our kind."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Don’t flee. We cannot abandon our capital."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: "$x1",
            y: "$y1",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_13",
        on: "moveto",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22terrain%22%3A%22*%5EV*%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Kalenz%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22role%22%3A%22Anduilas%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "hiss-die.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "torch.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 200,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
